lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小红书联手北大上交发布HYPIC，实现混合注意力大模型位置无关缓存</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删本地文件风险，建议用户关闭高权限模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">NVIDIA发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列模型，8B版本登顶RTEB检索基准</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026发布全球首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo样机</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/68fe962e114badc8c6fcdc554476836c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月17日，阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026正式展示全球首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo样机。该设备搭载智能体原生系统Step AOS，内置阶跃智能体Amoo，旨在实现AI Agent与移动终端的深度融合。系统界面包含“水产市场”、“灵魂设定”及“AI智能体安全”等模块，其中“灵魂设定”用于记录用户偏好与习惯，以提供个性化交互。现场演示显示，Amoo可自主完成任务规划与工具调用，如查询演唱会门票并直接跳转携程预订酒店。阶跃星辰表示，STEPX Neo正推动AI手机从语音助手向具备长期记忆与执行能力的智能体平台演进。目前该产品仍处于样机阶段，完整形态与功能细节将在后续公布。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度智能云发布秒哒3.5，支持iOS无代码打包与多端共享后端</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/034a29d8fcf2e23d0ffaddea6ce4ab39.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度智能云在2026世界人工智能大会（WAIC）正式发布无代码应用平台秒哒3.5版本，旨在进一步降低开发门槛。新版本核心功能包括：内置SEO Agent实现搜索优化自动化；提供一站式iOS打包服务，支持IPA生成、Ad Hoc真机测试及App Store上架；支持多端（Web、App、小程序）共享同一后端数据库，实现数据联动。针对开发痛点，3.5版本引入数据库多环境隔离机制，支持开发与线上环境独立运行及版本快照回滚，并提供后端资源分级配置，适配从个人Demo到企业级高并发业务的多种需求。此外，平台新增自定义技能功能，支持通过对话生成、导入技能包或接入第三方API。秒哒目前已服务超3500万用户，创造了350万个应用。此次更新通过自动化SEO、简化iOS交付及多端数据共享，显著提升了非专业开发者的应用构建与运维效</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小红书联手北大上交发布HYPIC，实现混合注意力大模型位置无关缓存</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e6ad809b9ef7e1a85a6090a69b472f2b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小红书大模型推理团队联合北京大学、上海交通大学提出HYPIC，这是首个针对混合注意力架构大模型实现位置无关缓存（PIC）的服务系统。该系统通过缓存“段累积转移算子”实现线性层常数时间的状态组合，并利用“缝合窗口”修复全注意力层的跨段对齐，同时引入实例间段并行机制加速冷请求。测试显示，在Qwen3.5-35B-A3B等4个生产级模型上，HYPIC将首token延迟（TTFT）平均降低3.25倍，同SLO下可持续QPS提升1.66倍，且任务质量与完全重算几乎无损。该技术解决了混合注意力模型因缺乏逐token抓手而无法使用传统PIC的难题，显著提升了RAG与Agent等长上下文场景的推理效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删本地文件风险，建议用户关闭高权限模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1fe23cdbfb2d4e1124d742028d9f7a35.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI确认由GPT-5.6模型驱动的Codex代码生成系统存在误删用户本地文件的风险。核心产品负责人Tibo Sottiaux指出，该问题主要发生在用户开启“完全访问模式”（full access mode）且未启用沙箱保护机制的情况下。模型在尝试通过覆盖环境变量$HOME设置临时工作目录时，操作异常导致系统误删整个$HOME目录，对macOS和Linux用户造成数据丢失风险。此外，关闭自动审核功能会增加触发概率。OpenAI目前正采取多项修复措施，包括更新完全访问模式下的提示说明并加强系统防护。官方建议正在使用Codex且开启系统级权限的用户立即关闭高权限模式，改用带安全限制的运行环境。OpenAI计划在未来几天发布详细事故分析报告，披露技术原因及后续改进方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">NVIDIA发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列模型，8B版本登顶RTEB检索基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">NVIDIA正式发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列嵌入向量模型，专为生产级RAG、智能体检索及代码检索设计。该系列包含8B-BF16、1B-BF16及针对Blackwell架构优化的1B-NVFP4三个版本，均基于Mistral架构，支持32K上下文及34种语言。在RTEB基准测试中，8B版本以78.46的平均NDCG@10得分位列榜首。1B-BF16版本较前代基线提升10.4分，而1B-NVFP4版本在保留99.5%精度的同时，吞吐量较BF16提升2倍。模型采用双向注意力掩码训练，并以OpenMDW-1.1协议开源。部署方面，8B和1B-BF16支持Transformers框架，1B-NVFP4专用于vLLM 0.25.0的/v2/embed接口。NVIDIA同步推出基于Rust构建的1B模型NIM微服</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
